{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e517adb786882ce2c69e0a537d51954365491441bf29fb6ffe4215f58e4be85a","ja":"好きなものをマスコットに！","zh":"把喜欢的东西做成吉祥物！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"94ecf8896c66a95baf030454f2ba85e17c50a5f27abab656e22f102e87ac1430","ja":"そうだなー……アタシのマスコットなら\n『クラウザー号』がモデルがいいかな。","zh":"让我想想……要是我的吉祥物，\n拿“克劳泽号”当原型挺好的吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0f0a69cf0d5b354c36ecae29c864ab34c7c1fa7db7b8fa588f75831c95aff8bc","ja":"じゃあ、オートバイから、\nロボットになるのはどうですか？","zh":"那从摩托车变成\n机器人怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1a5f9af412fb488dd87d1d0ca3b5aac17f4872cd5e8ee01d0bfd2ef71bdf7bcb","ja":"タイヤが、びょ～んって伸びて、攻撃するんです！","zh":"轮胎会“嗖——”地伸长展开攻击！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2a4a988ba2c90838fce374cbaccb6db2481b33e6740481e443e5532801d39608","ja":"変形ロボみたいな感じ？　強そうでいいね！\nクラウザー号と一緒に戦えたら、最高だよ♪","zh":"有点像变形机器人那种感觉？看起来很强，真棒！\n要是能和克劳泽号一起战斗的话，那就太棒了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"23f007b65add2318383be55a11e8106000e46145aa3856333b7b46dceaf7dfae","ja":"こういうの考えるの、楽しいね。\nねえ、他のみんなのマスコットも考えてみない？","zh":"想这些东西真开心呢。\n呐，要不要也帮大家想想吉祥物？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bbb2a442b6d431a1f2412a0d1567776c2ff60c6a23de336626ddaeb67a41f5fb","ja":"はい♪　みんなのも、みんなが\n好きなものから考えるといいでしょうか～？","zh":"好的♪　大家的礼物，也从大家\n喜欢的事物去考虑比较好吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7421b67a9de112e03144daa6a2d2a4ad66e0be6a64049eda54328e451b2f0e27","ja":"そうだね。ジュリアは……ギターのピックなんてどう？\nピックが巨大化して、ジュリアを守る盾になるとか！","zh":"也是呢。茱莉亚的话……吉他拨片怎么样？\n拨片变得巨大化，化身为保护茱莉亚的盾牌之类的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9612103df4ae17b7b7eb4f0d490201707e311e694df4b4e5c057bbf15f8d4f20","ja":"かっこいいですー！　じゃあ、歩さんは……\nワサビ？　ビューって、辛いビームで攻撃とか。","zh":"好帅气啊～！那步小姐是……\n芥末？咻——地发射辛辣光线进行攻击之类的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"af597fd888655927e37a4f791a2d1939d64de92272c90c12eaab3282070841da","ja":"あははっ、それって本物のワサビでもいけそうだね。\n歩なら……ラジカセとかスピーカーもいいかも？","zh":"啊哈哈，那样的话感觉用真芥末也行得通呢。\n如果是步的话……手提音响或者音箱说不定也不错？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"1a58ef36484576f87307d8eb3725f7818d8d0800021a0bed71be1aa48ed1542b","ja":"音楽を聞かせてくれるマスコットって、オシャレ\nですね♪　春香さんだと……お菓子作りの道具とか？","zh":"能播放音乐的吉祥物，真时髦\n呢♪　春香的话……会是做点心的道具之类的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"6a8e005f1c79c15c956f83a7f3842ed30bea6d0614338789459712a16ac7a1ae","ja":"泡だて器とか、面白いマスコットになりそう！\nやよいは……調理道具とか？　春香と似ちゃうかな？","zh":"打蛋器之类的，感觉能做成很有意思的吉祥物！\n弥生是……厨具之类的？会不会和春香重了呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"3789571756ba0de45b73642319fe7c9606c4192c83f76efd7dc0e0fb870d71bd","ja":"もやしパーティーの鉄板とかなら、違うのに\nなりそうですね。このみさんは……お酒？","zh":"如果是豆芽派对的铁板之类的，感觉会\n不太一样呢。木实姐的是……酒吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"59f05d0cbf022935f8730c5b8e8c7dc7fbb380030dc5d540e0def4d59ee45c34","ja":"あとは麻雀牌とか……うーん……やっぱり、\n『セクシーゴースト』のままがいいかも……？","zh":"还有麻将牌什么的……嗯……果然，\n还是保持“性感幽灵”比较好吧……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"16216436c5b82da4dd0de41754414e2d7a9993afd63ae3cac590ed427f10856e","ja":"一時間後……","zh":"一小时后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"af5e6777c3f039ceb8998448655ade33341036d7a8990d0e7046e2bc195798ba","ja":"あっ、もうこんな時間！？\nノートがアイディアで、いっぱいになりましたね！","zh":"啊，已经这个时间了！？\n笔记本上已经写满了各种想法呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1736.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"ae5820d6cbe7212d212f590fb88671707259a2a9e6e5ebaa49c71a90ed96e4ea","ja":"楽しかったね♪　そうだ！　せっかくだし、このノート\n写真に撮って、SNSにアップしちゃおっか！","zh":"玩得好开心呢♪对了！机会难得，把这本笔记本\n拍下来发到社交平台上吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
